  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Darling Home in Seagrove Beach with a Private Pool, Pool Spa, & Guest Suite (pool and spa heating for an additional fee) only available October- March. This home also has the largest county managed beach access in Walton county, stretching over 14 blocks. <br><br>Escape to this spacious and elegant getaway just outside of Old Seagrove, where you'll be just a short walk from the beach, local shops, and excellent restaurants. The home also includes the use of a street-legal, six-passenger golf cart, making the beach and Seaside town center so much closer! This beautiful, fully furnished home features multiple living areas, a newly updated kitchen, and an enclosed, furnished lanai with a large private pool and pool spa. This property includes the main house and a carriage house suite complete with a kitchenette.<br><br>What's nearby:<br>Take a short walk through your tree-lined neighborhood to hit the sands of Seagrove Beach. Just a little over a mile from this rental is Seaside, where you'll find a number of shops, restaurants, and the Saturday morning Seaside Farmers Market. Head over to Grayton Beach State Park, a 2,200-acre state park with hiking trails, salt marshes, sea oat-covered dunes, crystal-white sand, and blue-green waters, only three miles away. And if you're looking to fish, there are several charters nearby, offering fun and exciting offshore and bay fishing excursions.<br><br>Things to know:<br>High speed wifi<br>4K Roku TV in all bedrooms and living spaces<br>Sonos music system in the main living area<br>Full gourmet chef’s kitchen in the main house with a 36-inch induction range, a vent-hood, wine fridge, and Vitamix blender<br>Kitchenette in the guest house with a minifridge, microwave, and coffee maker<br>Weber four-burner, high-capacity grill<br>Casper mattresses and hotel-quality pillows and linens<br>Outdoor shower available<br>Beach toys and a separate full-size refrigerator in the garage<br>Driveway parking for three vehicles (no street parking available)<br><br>Bedding Arrangements:<br>Main house: Three king beds (two on the first floor and one on the second floor) and one queen bed (located on the second floor)<br>Carriage house: Queen over queen bunk and a twin with twin trundle. Located on the second floor of carriage all in one room. The first floor is a garage for the golf cart.<br>Total: Three kings, three queens, and two twins.<br>pets are allowed at this vacation rental with prior approval only.<br>Parking notes: There is free parking available for 3 vehicles.<br>Security camera details: Please note there is a surveillance camera located at the garage facing the driveway.<br><br>County permit number: 5230<br><br>Please note: this home resides in a noise-sensitive area and the owners participate in our Good Neighbor protection program. Our smart home technology will alert our team if excessive decibel or occupancy levels are detected, allowing us to reach out directly with a reminder of maximum occupancy and quiet hours. This technology is privacy compliant, and only monitors the presence of decibels and devices-not any personal conversation or information. Thank you for supporting our efforts to be good neighbors!",
